### =========================
### MEMBER API TEST
### Base URL: {{baseUrl}}
### Required token: Bearer {{accessToken}}
### =========================


### 1. Get my member profile (M01)
GET http://{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/members/me/profile
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### 2. Update my member profile (M02)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/members/me/profile
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "fullName": "Nguyễn Văn Member Updated",
  "phone": "0900000005",
  "gender": "MALE",
  "dateOfBirth": "2002-05-20",
  "fitnessGoal": "LOSE_FAT"
}


### 3. Get member by id - admin/staff only
GET {{baseUrl}}/members/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### 4. Get all members - admin/staff only
GET {{baseUrl}}/members
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### 5. Search members by keyword - admin/staff only
GET {{baseUrl}}/members/search?keyword=member
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### 6. Update member status - admin/staff only
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/members/1/status
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}


### 7. Test unauthorized - no token
GET {{baseUrl}}/members/me
Accept: application/json